 "_about": "THE studio sound signature, shared by every brand: one REAL sound per idea. events = library sounds per engine event (first available in the list is used, so public CC0 fallbacks keep working when licensed packs are absent); musical = orchestra gags + leitmotifs by role (library/sound/music); signature = stings; places = room tone + walla per background set. sfx.py kit copies everything into a project's sfx/. Missing = silent and reported, never synth.",
